window.products.push({"id":965066,"name":"Wireless Meat Thermometer Wireless with Bluetooth, 165ft Long Range Meat&Food Thermometer, Meat Thermometers for Oven, Grilling, Cooking, Smokers, BBQ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pS1ys9fKL._AC_.jpg","description":"✔️ Product Specifications: Probe size: 5.1* 0.23 in  Charging dock size: 6.77*1.25*0.78in  Probe Charging time: 20 minutes  Probe Working time: 6 hours  Bluetooth Version: Bluetooth 5.2  Waterproof of the probe: IP67  Food temperature range: -40℃ ~ 100℃  Environment temp range: 32F ~ 572F (0℃ ~ 300℃)  Distance of the bluetooth:Up tp 50 meters(165ft)  ✔️ Product Features: 100% wireless and compatible with the latest Bluetooth 5.2 ——perfect for outdoor and indoor cooking. Estimated completion time display ——It shows the meat temp and an estimated cooking time, no more guessing game, no more overcook. Support for custom menus and temperatures ——Suitable for Cooking Beginners and BBQ Lovers, Guiding You to be a Chef, Cooking the Delicious Food for Families. Preset 9 food types and 5 maturity options ——Help you cooking different meals,guided you through every cooking process to guarantee perfect and consistent APP can support 6 probes simultaneously ——Especially for hotels, restaurants, parties, BBQ grill thermometer wireless bluetooth can working with 6 probes simultaneously, improving the efficiency and increasing meats supply. 💚3 Steps Connect the Probe: ❶ Search the keyword in APP Store or Google Play for \"Aicooking\" to download the app and also scan the QR code on the box to download, recharge the wireless meat thermometer for 20 minutes at the same time. ❷ Turn on the Bluetooth of your mobile phone(IOS system), Android have to turn on the Bluetooth and GPS at the same time. ❸ Take out of the probe, click the APP, and the probe will connect automatically. Note: The app will not ask for your email account password, permission to snoop in your contacts and permission to view and change your photos. 💚Warm Tips: 1. If the food is wrapped in tinfoil or your oven has the anti-radiation function, the Bluetooth signal may be blocked. Closing the grill lid may interfere with the Bluetooth signal.If the probe is disturbed and disconnected, keep it close enough. 2. Do not use this probe in a microwave oven because the microwave may damage internal components! 3. If the probe has been connected to a phone, it cannot be connected to another phone. 4. It can be fully charged in 20-25 minutes even if the indicator light does not turn green.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pS1ys9fKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Busch-Jaeger","source_asin":"B0BZMHLSGP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZMHLSGP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZMHLSGP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
