window.products.push({"id":965132,"name":"Kivik Fluffy Faux Fur Comforter Set Queen Size, Shaggy Long Fur Comforter Set,Luxury Soft Warm Plush Sherpa Reversible Bedding Set of 3 (1 Shaggy Comf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jOEUB7l0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What You’ll Get: Kivik Shaggy Faux Fur Comforter Sets come in 3 sizes - twin, queen, and king, each including 1 twin size comforter (68\" x 88\") and 2 pillowcases (20\" x 26\"), 1 queen size comforter (88\" x 88\") and 2 pillowcases (20\" x 30\"), 1 king size comforter (104\" x 88\") and 2 pillowcases (20\" x 36\"). This comforter set is a compact 2-in-1 down alternative with cover, one-piece design great for all season use. Cloud-soft Sensations: Kivik faux fur bedding set features 280GSM long fur and same-color 220GSM Sherpa reverse, containing top-grade quilt core. Microfiber is light and smooth to the touch. Tucking in it feels like floating over the clouds, you’ll ease right into snooze without a single care in the world. Meticulously Made: The comforter is quilted on point to grid the core for a fluffier, softer, and warmer finish without cluttering or aggregating. Tightly stitched, the bedding set is made snug to conform to the body for a stress-free slumbering experience. Matching pillowcases offer an uniformed luxury look to fit the decor. Wash & Care: Vacuum compressed for packaging, the comforter set will restore to its fluffiness and smoothness with an easy shake. The comforter is machine washable with cold water, fluff it up after air dry to resume its luxury texture. There may be slight shedding in the first use, comb through the fur to get rid of loose hair. The Best Winter Gift: Kivik is dedicated to providing top quality sleep experience. Luxury shaggy faux fur bedding set are the yummiest winter gift for parents, children, family, friends, and pals. They are suitable for any settings, be it bedroom, guest room, kid’s room, RV, vacation room etc. All Kivik products are covered with 30 day refund and lifetime warranty. For any issues with the product, please contact us and we will respond within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jOEUB7l0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kivik","source_asin":"B0994RJNB7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965132","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0994RJNB7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0994RJNB7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
