window.products.push({"id":965177,"name":"Fridge Freezer Thermometer Max/Min Memory LXSZRPH High & Low Temperature Alarms Settings with LED Indicator Digital Refrigeration Thermometer with Mag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xZwIgmJVL._SL1209_.jpg","description":"This digital alarm thermometer is essential for freezer, fridge, refrigerator,wine cooler,fish tank,room. Get accurate temperature readings with this miniature digital thermometer which has a simple design, unobtrusive design and a clear and easy to read LCD display. Ideal for use in indoor outdoor, kitchens, restaurants, bars, aquariums, and cafes. Specification: Measurement accuracy: ±1°C. Measuring Temperature Range: In(-10℃～+50℃ (+14℉ ～ +122℉); out(-50℃～+70℃ (-58℉ ～ +158℉) Power supply:1.5V (LR44) x1 (Included) Size:65*60*18mm(2.5*2.3*0.7inch) EASY TO OPERATE: 4 buttons to complete the main functions of the digital fridge thermometer: 【IN/OUT Key】: Inner and Outer Temperature Conversion. Outer temperature is the temperature from sensor. So after inserting the sensor plug into the thermometer, you can use the sensor detect the outdoor or the freezer temperature(Put the sensor line in the freezer, close the freezer door, and put the thermometer outside the freezer); 【MIN/MAX key】: View recorded Minimum and Maximum temperature. Will detect the max/min temprature automatically when the thermometer works; 【AL key】: Set the alarm temperature range; or turn on/off the alarm function; 【ADJ/℃/℉ key】: Adjust the value under setted; or change temperature unit between Celsius (℃) and Fahrenheit (℉) in the normal display. Package included: 1 x Freezer Thermometer 2 x button battery (1 + 1 as spare) 1 x User Manual 1pair x Velcro(make the thermometer easier to adsorb on any surface) 1 x sucker（for fix the sensor line easily) WARRANTY: This product promises 365 days warranty from the date of purchase.If by any chance the product is defective, please contact us by email, we will arange a refund or replacement within 24 hours.In case we do not respond so quickly, please do not worry, we will give you a satisfactory answer within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xZwIgmJVL._SL1209_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nithing","source_asin":"B075HZG2GK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075HZG2GK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075HZG2GK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
