window.products.push({"id":965275,"name":"6 PCS Cord Organizer for Appliances Cord Wrap Cord Holder Cable Organizer Cord Winder Cord Organizer for Kitchen Appliances for Mixer Blender, Coffee ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fK0OjYlRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Make Your Kitchen Tidy - Our wrap cord organizer keeps you away from the trouble of messy appliance cords, away from the kitchen cluttered and prone to safety hazards. Easily organize cords and keep your kitchen tidy. Our cable winder saves you from having to worry about the messy power cords of small kitchen appliances. All your kitchen equipment wires will be in order. High-Quality Material - Each cord keeper is made of high-quality rubber, durable and not easily deformed. The glue on the bottom is a high-quality glue selected for many tests, and it is not easy to fall off. Great Design: Kitchen appliance cord wrapper allows you to easily wrap wires in one hand, and the cord wrapper is compatible with 70% of the kitchen appliances wire. Wide Application: You will receive New 6 Pcs Cord Organizer Clips with extra strong sticky pad, which suitable for all kinds of home kitchen equipment, such as coffee machines, mixer, blenders, air fryer, toaster, pressure cooker, juicer. Convenient Design - When you use various small appliances in the kitchen, you don't have to worry about messy power cords, this is a small hub specially designed to solve the trouble of messy household cords. The ends can be twisted to wrap around wires. The whole product is made of high-quality silicone with good ductility. Finally, the end wires can be fixed. The card slot in the middle can help you solve the trouble of messy lines. Easy to Install - Please wipe the surface of the appliance （please wait after the surface dry） Peel off the plastic paper. Attach THE CORD ORGANIZER TO the appliance firmly. The cord organizer is ready to use AFTER WAITING 24 HOURS. Then the cord organizer will stay stuck to appliance, won’t fall off easily. Keep Home Clean and Tidy： This Kitchen Auxiliary Cord Holder is compatible with various brands of mixers and kitchen appliances, keeping your cable cords hidden and tangled; This cord wrap is an absolute space saver, allowing better cable storage to keep your kitchen home space tidy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fK0OjYlRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WANTELL","source_asin":"B0BMXCXL9T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965275","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMXCXL9T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMXCXL9T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
