window.products.push({"id":965490,"name":"243 Pc Sage Green Baby Shower Decorations For Boy Or Girl, Rustic Gender Neutral Sage Green & White Balloon Garland Kit, Greenery BABY Boxes, Eucalypt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zw+4WtMsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Polyester 243 PIECE MEGA BUNDLE: So much VALUE! With 243 different sage green baby shower decoration, this amazing mega bundle has everything you need to throw your dream gender neutral baby shower! Get Oh Baby backdrop banners photo props, boho green white and gold balloon garland arch kit, 4 unique BABY balloon boxes super fun gold oh baby confetti, eucalyptus and more - all in one massive, easy-to-assemble kit! (See description for a full list) UNIQUE CUSTOM DESIGNS: We put lots of love and attention into our designs so you can celebrate your new bundle of joy...in style! From a super cute oh baby sign and matching baby boxes with letters for baby shower to beautiful sage green balloons garland and gender reveal decorations confetti, our adorable decorations add style and wonder to any boy baby shower decorations and baby shower decorations for girl! PREMIUM QUALITY MATERIALS: Bring your party to life with beautifully crafted baby shower decor that stand out above the rest. Our BABY blocks are made with strong 350 msg cardstock paper, gold foil print and other non-toxic materials. Our greenery Oh Baby background (72.8 x 43.3\") is made with heavy-duty polyester fabric that is easy to clean, tear-resistant, washable, easy to set up with chic gold foil grommet at every corner for easy hanging and a beautiful design for a \"wow factor\" event! SAGE GREEN BALLOON GARLAND KIT- Who has time for complicated decoration assembly when you’re a busy mom-to-be? Now with step by step instructions your balloon arch comes with 127 balloons ( sage green, white balloons, metallic gold, nude and confetti balloons) 5x eucalyptus leaves and garland making tools. All that’s left to do is hang the gender reveal backdrop, set up your display box add the oh baby confetti and pass out the party games! Ahh, shouldn’t ALL party planning be this easy? NO HELIUM REQUIRED: Forget about buying a fancy helium machine or visiting your local grocery store to fill up your baby shower balloons. All they need is a bit of good old-fashioned air! Just blow them up, insert in our 16 feet garland tape, weave in the greenery eucalyptus leaves, hang the backdrop then add your table confetti paper for seriously stunning 1st birthday celebration, baby reveal party decorations, jungle safari, woodland theme and more! Love it or your money back guaranteed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Zw+4WtMsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REGAL DECORATIONS","source_asin":"B09XN8TY3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XN8TY3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XN8TY3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":965491,"name":"Privacy Window Film, Static Cling Embossing Glass Tint Frosted Privacy Window Decal No Glue Removable Window Stickers - Home Security and Decorative, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hAJF-ghnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Bamboo Privacy Window Film has Magic 3D rainbow effects, Provides Good Privacy, Protects Skin And Eyes, And Prevents Furniture From Fading And Aging By Blocking Out More Than 97% Harmful Rays And Filtering Strong Light. While Show You A Comfortable And Decorative Home Where Has no Disturbance From Dazzling Strong Light And UV Rays When You Are Enjoying The Natural Sunshine! High-performance Vinyl + Super static cling, lasting from 3 to 5 years. Tips: 1, Always put the film on the inside of window and only apply it to smooth glass surfaces. 2, Affix tape on a corner of the back side to quickly remove the clear backing. 3, For best results, do not apply film in direct sunlight or during freezing weather. 4, A helper is especially necessary when applying film to large windows. Having an extra hand will enable you to steady the film and work through issues if they arise. 5, Don't apply to the window frame. Cut off excessive edges after application if needed. Don't know how to use it? Don't worry, the static cling film is very easy to apply ! Step 1. Keep Window or Glass cleanStep 2. Wet the Window or Glass with water.( Soapy water will be better ) Step 3. Remove the Static Film from backing protect film, and then the smooth side should be post to the window. (Please MAKE SURE you have removed protect film before you apply the window film to glass) Step 4. When you install it, Apply to wet glass and smooth with hands. Step 5. Squeegee away water and air bubbles. Step 6. Much easier than Wall Decals, it's no problem for you. Step 7. Enjoy your works! GENUINE CUSTOMER SERVICE: Contact us anytime via Amazon for a free refund or replacement, no question asked, no return necessary! For any product related questions or concerns, just let us know and we'll endeavor to respond within 24hrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hAJF-ghnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jahoot","source_asin":"B08343G2MY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08343G2MY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08343G2MY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
