window.products.push({"id":965684,"name":"NJCharms Ceramic Spoon Rest For Stove Top, Large Spoon Holder For Kitchen Counter Top, White Cute Coffee Spoon Rests, Cooking Utensil Rest, Premium Fa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oUs-I70rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Practical and Versatile: Say goodbye to kitchen stains. This heat-resistant spoon rest can be placed in cooking areas such as stoves, countertops, or placed in any area where prep work or cooking is done. As a habitat for soap and sponges are also a good choice. The spoon rest for stove top can accommodate a variety of utensils without taking up too much space on the stove. Healthy Ceramic: Following the concept of environmental protection, sturdy and long-lasting cooking spoon rest is made of ceramic, lead-free, and cadmium-free. The porcelain stove spoon holder will never scratch, rust, melt, or age. Nice heavy to keep it sit firmly on the counter and it won't move around when resting spoons. Dishwasher Friendly: Life is easy and enjoyable, you don't need to worry about how to clean stove spoon rest when you are tired. After happy home cooking, just put it in the dishwasher and clean it up in one step. Less mess, less stress, happy kitchen. Generous Size: No need to hesitate to choose the size of the ceramic spoon rest for stove top. NJCharms spoon rest with a wide square surface that can fit all utensils. Stop sauce flow out to your countertop, and place tools onto utensil rest. Let the spoon holder for stove top come into your life, it's a decoration that can be easily matched with different kitchens. Super-Cute: Farmhouse Design utensil rest will surely add a country charm to your kitchen countertops, stovetops, or coffee bars. The beautiful spoon holder for stove top could bring you a good mood and great convenience. Add a soul kitchen decor for your family and friend, the gifts suit for housewarmings, weddings, anniversaries, holiday, Christmas, valentine's day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oUs-I70rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NJCHARMS","source_asin":"B0BM8SFWSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM8SFWSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM8SFWSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":965685,"name":"KitchenAid KG300 Box Grater, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QK0J6MKGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Like all the KitchenAid gadgets this one is solidly built and thoughtfully designed. This box grater has a large rolled handle for comfortable gripping, and a padded bottom to keep your counters safe. It is dishwasher safe for easy cleaning. The angle ensures that minimal downward effort is required for grating food, while the little storage container gives you a convenient place to catch the grated food as well as stow any extras for future use. Four sides allow you to grate anything from fine breadcrumbs to coarsely shredded potatoes for latkes. Amazon.com Its bottom rimmed with rubber for slip-resistant stability on the counter, this stylish box grater is made of mirror-finish, 18/8 stainless steel and provides a serious cook with three grating blades and one slicing blade. For convenience, a 3-cup plastic container fits snugly inside the grater to catch food. The grater is calibrated in 1/2-cup gradations, has a lid for storage, and is dishwasher-, microwave-, and freezer-safe. There are three grating blades: fine for breadcrumbs, cheese, chocolate, and nutmeg; medium for pulping fruits and vegetables; and coarse for hard vegetables like potatoes and beets. The slicing blade creates uniform 1-1/2 slices in a jiffy. The grater has a large, round, satin-finish, stainless-steel handle and a rugged plastic top. It's rust-resistant and dishwasher-safe. KitchenAid says the first year of the grater's lifetime warranty against defects is \"hassle-free,\" with a replacement shipped at no cost and without question if a defect is detected. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QK0J6MKGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B00006CRSA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965685","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006CRSA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006CRSA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
