window.products.push({"id":965717,"name":"PHF Waffle Sherpa Blanket Queen Size, Luxury Warm Plush Flannel Blanket for Winter, No Shed No Pilling Cozy Soft Waffle Weave Fleece Blanket for Bed a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pp4brKc6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Creative Design: PHF premium waffle sherpa blanket adopts double-sided design of waffle and sherpa texture to make this creative and stylish blanket. One side of this warm blanket is delicate waffle weave, and the other side is fuzzy sherpa, which overall features fluffy feel, better warmth and lightweight, softness, offering extreme comfort and fresh sleeping experience all year round. I believe you will like the soft and relaxed feeling when hugging it. Waffle Weave Texture: Classic waffle weave design of the blanket feature puffy and warmth appearance, chic and sophisticated touch. The combination of waffle texture and sherpa make our sherpa blanket more elegant and outstading from other normal sherpa blanket. Available in classic solid colors, these waffle sherpa blankets perfectly complement any home décor. Just add a fresh and stylish layer to your bed or sofa with our waffle weave blanket. No Shed & No Pilling: PHF upgraded sherpa blanket has the characteristics of fading resistance and shrinkage resistance, and it is not easy to fuzz or fall off, even after repeated washing and endless use. Besides, neat and strong seams strengthen the firm connection at the joints. With the help of the dense sewing process, the durability of the flannel sherpa blanket is guaranteed. Easy Care: Machine wash separately in cold water, gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Tumble dry on low heat or lay flat to dry. Remove promptly. Warm iron as needed. No pilling, no shrink, no fade, labor tests show that the throw blanket keep its shape and stay brands new after multiple wash cycles. What You Can Get: PHF Sherpa Waffle Blanket Queen Size(90\" X 90\"), perfect for bed couch sofa, essential daily use blanket and home decoration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pp4brKc6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PHF","source_asin":"B0B9H6KLGH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9H6KLGH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9H6KLGH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
