window.products.push({"id":965744,"name":"Entertaining with Caspari Falling Snow Cocktail Napkins, Silver, Pack of 20","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ydjmA-2kL._AC_SL1008_.jpg","description":"Entertaining with Caspari falling snow silver cocktail napkins, pack of 20. Adapt the elegance of a formal table setting to everyday life with our luxury paper plates and napkins. Printed in Germany using non-toxic, water-soluble dyes on the softest three-ply tissue printable, these paper cocktail napkins have the feel of linen without the maintenance. Disposability means less time spent on clean-up and more time with friends and family. They are 100% biodegradable and compostable, combining convenience with sustainability. This pack contains 20 napkins, each measuring 5-inch square folded and 10-inch square open. Caspari - bringing style and convenience into your home every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ydjmA-2kL._AC_SL1008_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caspari","source_asin":"B01CV9D1I0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CV9D1I0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CV9D1I0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":965745,"name":"Mino Ware Japanese Rice Bowl Set Authentic Ceramic Chawan Set of 2 Dragon Blue from Japan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.11,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EiyVlE0iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Minoware refers to the great tradition and classical style of Japanese pottery. With a long history dating back over 1300 years, it is both an art form and a functional craft that produces practical items for daily use. It was certified as a traditional craftwork by The Ministry of International Trade and Industry in 1978. Minoyaki is a broad term that encompasses several styles of pottery with diverse colors, finishes, and enamels. Some famous examples of Minoyaki are as follows: Hino-Yaki is rich black or brown, warm and earthy. Oribe-Yaki is fresh with dark greens and less constraints on the traditional design. Kiseto-Yaki is known for light yellow and intriguing washes of green paints. Setokuro is glossy and black, achieved with quick high temperature firings. The name Minoyaki itself references the Mino region where it originated, located in the present-day Gifu Prefecture with high concentrations of Minoyaki artisans in Toki City, Tajimi City, Mizunami City, Kani City. Today the Mino region still produces over 50% of the pottery made in Japan. In the rich and complex world of Japanese arts and aesthetics, Minoyaki is of great cultural value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EiyVlE0iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mino Ware","source_asin":"B084P554DK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965745","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084P554DK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084P554DK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
