window.products.push({"id":965755,"name":"Groomsmen Proposal Cards - Groomsman Best Man Invitation Set - 9 Will You Be My Groomsman and 1 Best Man","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KlvCYrXHL._AC_.jpg","description":"MAKE IT OFFICIAL WITH THIS HIGH QUALITY INVITATION PACK Invite your friends to be a part of this very important day Let you Best Man and Groomsmen know that they are your choice for fun times and moral support during this exciting time in your life.These cards are guaranteed to have your bro team beaming in joy. Standout Quality  This isn’t your regular greeting card. It’s a whole 50% thicker than most of the ones you’ll find on the market. Made using 300gm paper, it creates a premium impression at first feel and complements the message you’ve penned with a touch of quality. Every 5” x 7” card comes with a kraft envelope to keep it clean and pristine. And we’ve ensured the card remains free of folds, creases, and dirt during transit by thoughtfully shipping it in proper packaging. Go ahead, celebrate your big decision with a card durable enough to be a keepsake. Here’s why you’ll love this invitation set: - Has a fun message that your guys will love. - The simple and classy design suits any taste. - Made using extra-thick card stock for enhanced sturdiness. - Comes with a high-quality kraft envelope. - Measures 5” x 7” and is blank inside to give you room to write. - Large enough to fit something inside. - Carefully packed to keep it pristine during shipping. - Backed by a no-hassle, 100% money-back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KlvCYrXHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seymour Butz","source_asin":"B09WGJM1JD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WGJM1JD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WGJM1JD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
