window.products.push({"id":965787,"name":"Kazeila 2 Pack Artificial Potted Plants, Fake Eucalyptus Rosemary Plants in Concrete Pot, Faux Plants for Home Office Shelf Table Desk Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ij3-djaQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Lifelike Mini Potted Fake Plants】 – The 2 pack mini artificial potted greenery set comprises one eucalyptus and one rosemary plant, all faux plastic plants are placed in gorgeous and sturdy concrete pots. These vivid potted plants appear so lifelike, and you could hardly tell them from real ones and might feel the want to water them! 【Durable Pots Made of Real Concrete】 – Unlike most potted mini fake decoration plants that’re placed in concrete look pulp pots, our artificial eucalyptus and rosemary are sturdily planted in real concrete pots measures 4x4 inch, which is durable, long-lasting and textured. What’s more, there are beautiful decorative patterns on the pots to make these fake plants even more suitable for indoor decorations. 【Premium Material, Easy Maintenance】 – Made of high-quality and pure plastic, our artificial plants are crafted to be realistic and durable at the same time. The artificial plants are easy to take care of, all you need to do is wipe plant leaves with water to remove dust. Our artificial plants always look full and fresh every day, perfect choice for people who are not good at taking care of real plants. 【Perfect Indoor Decoration】 – Artificial potted plants look so real they'll breathe new life into whatever room they're placed in. Decorate your furnishings and office space with these high-quality mini fake potted plants. Whether you're relaxing in your bedroom, living room, or bathroom, you'll be able to appreciate nature's splendor. Housewarming parties, weddings, and the holidays are all excellent occasions to give them as gifts. 【Product Measurements】 – You will receive two beautiful artificial potted plants, both of eucalyptus and rosemary are 10 inches tall and 8 inches wide.Throughout the years, we've worked tirelessly to ensure that our consumers receive only the best items. Our success depends on the satisfaction of our clients. If you ever encounter any problem of the Faux Small Houseplants, please don’t hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ij3-djaQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kazeila","source_asin":"B0BLCT4PYB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLCT4PYB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLCT4PYB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
