window.products.push({"id":965903,"name":"JOZEFINA ATELIER Shell Platter Marble Red 589","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":55.08,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o87MkckOL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"The Jozefina Factory was founded in 1982 by Jozef Jankowski, a well-known artist and glass blower. His daughter-Ella Jankowska Fishman has emerged as a leading glass designer. Her designs bring a breath of freshness to the art glass world. Jozefina Art Glass Atelier is recognized worldwide as a leading European manufacturer of hand blown art glass combining sophisticated, classical and contemporary design with highly skilled craftsmanship. Inspired design, expressive style, beautiful and elegant shapes make our art glass unusual and innovative. Each piece is hand blown and hand finished which makes every item artistic and unique. At Jozefina we value the old, traditional techniques of glass blowing dated back as far as the 10th century. We are located in Krosno-Poland, the oldest glass and crystal producing area in Europe. The artistic skill of fine art glass blowing has been passed down through the family generations. Our masters glass blowers create art rarely found today. We are delighted to introduce a wide variety of shapes and vibrant colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o87MkckOL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOZEFINA ATELIER","source_asin":"B01M6UOWAN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M6UOWAN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M6UOWAN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":965904,"name":"Personalized Christmas Ornaments Family of 2 – Polyresin Panda Bear Couple Ornament – Unique Family Christmas Ornaments 2022 – Gifts for Mom, Dad, Kid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q0uu1fQxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Polyresin Christmas Ornaments for Couples – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our 2022 Panda Ornament Family of 2 is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of Panda Bear couple. This holiday season, express your joy and love to all the family members with this special family couples Christmas ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – unlike other customized ornaments for couples that often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every 2022 family love ornament is delicately hand painted to ensure its unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND couple Christmas ornaments you’ll always cherish. Celebrate Life's Biggest Moments – These Panda ornaments for Christmas tree have a place reserved for every member of the family, from little tykes and siblings to Mom, Dad, Grandma and Grandpa! Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors and personalized to your specifications, your personalized family ornaments will make your Christmas decorations indoor feel extra special and unique to your family home. This holiday season, give the gift of joy! 24 Hour Order Processing – our 2022 personalized Christmas ornaments for couples make beautiful, unique gifts for Dad, Mom, Grandma and Grandpa. Your resin family ornament will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! The most precious keepsake and perfect gifts for families to create loving and lasting memories that will surely be cherished forever and will stand the test of time – just like the love of family. Happy Family - at Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful, unique family ornaments decorations for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 custom tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship, if for any reason you don’t love your personalized couple ornaments for Christmas tree, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Q0uu1fQxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B07JHLLLZH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JHLLLZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JHLLLZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
