window.products.push({"id":965995,"name":"Bissell 17251 Little Green ProHeat Carpet Cleaner with Turbo Brush","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DS4M2AQ2L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Put the power of a Bissell to work on deep-down dirt. This Little Green Proheat Turbobrush Extractor is a portable deep cleaner with a built-in heater. Powerful rotating brushes loosen and remove deep-down dirt. Cleans spots, spills and hard-to-reach areas like stairs, upholstery and auto interiors. Features include 48-oz. collection/dirty water tank, 48-oz. solution/clean water tank, 4\" cleaning tool, heat indicator light, trigger spray, 5.5' vacuum flex hose and 20' cord. 1-yr. full manufacturer's warranty. No. 1725-1. Imported. 17-3/4Hx12-3/4Wx13-1/4D\" Amazon.com Perfect for spot-cleaning carpets and for stairs, upholstery, auto interiors, and even mattresses, this portable machine deep-cleans by forcing a warm solution of water and cleansing concentrate into fibers and vacuuming up the dirty solution. The 1200-watt machine has a water heater for boosting performance by increasing the cleaning solution's temperature (up to but not exceeding 180 degrees F) and preventing the solution from cooling. At the flick of a switch, the machine's powered hand-tool with a 4-inch-wide brush roll attached to a flexible hose either brushes with a spray of cleaning solution or vacuums. A separate 4-inch cleaning tool/brush without a powered brush roll also is included. It's intended for upholstery and mattresses. Here's how the machine works: On its front is a removable plastic tank into which goes a mixture of hot tap water and Bissell's Little Green Formula (8 ounces included). Next to this tank is a removable tank for collecting dirty water. A trigger on the hand-tool's handle applies solution as desired. The machine measures 12 inches wide, 16 inches high, and 10-1/2 inches deep. It has cord (20 feet long) and hose storage and carries a 1-year warranty against defects. --Fred Brack From the Manufacturer 4-inch cleaning path 4-inch cleaning path Comes with four-inch upholstery tool and TurboBrush Comes with four-inch upholstery tool and TurboBrush 20-foot power cord 20-foot power cord Rotating TurboBrush Rotating TurboBrush 9 amp motor 9 amp motor 48-ounce tank capacity 48-ounce tank capacity Great for cleaning upholstery, stairs, and automobiles Great for cleaning upholstery, stairs, and automobiles The only portable deep cleaner with a built-in heater providing 25% improved cleaning performance The only portable deep cleaner with a built-in heater providing 25% improved cleaning performance Powerful rotating brushes loosen and remove deep-down dirt Powerful rotating brushes loosen and remove deep-down dirt Lightweight and easy to use Lightweight and easy to use See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41DS4M2AQ2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bissell","source_asin":"B00005NWX8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-965995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005NWX8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005NWX8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
